00:19:44,620 --> 00:19:50,120
Another way is to have a memory tool to recall them all. One example of this is Murder's Inc.

212
00:19:50,380 --> 00:19:58,360
or Murder's Link. M for muscular, U for urinary, R for respiratory, D for digestive, E for endocrine,

213
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:04,360
second R for reproductive, I for integumentary, N for neurologic, and C for circulation,

214
00:20:04,360 --> 00:20:09,420
both cardiovascular and lymphatic. Or if we are doing the MURDERS-Link variation,

215
00:20:10,100 --> 00:20:15,940
L is for lymphatic and C is for cardiovascular. Now, if you are making a reference card,

216
00:20:16,260 --> 00:20:20,520
it might help to order them in some sort of way that makes more sense than the MURDERS-Ink tool.

217
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:26,580
As we demonstrated in the example, handoff reports using this system often begin with neuro,

