00:20:26,860 --> 00:20:32,280
respiratory, cardiovascular, and then move on from there. This sort of matches the level of

219
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:37,680
consciousness and ABC approach we use in EMS. Whatever way you choose to organize is fine.

